#: ../../source/docs/common-ark-fpv-overview.rst:5
#: e5f450c1972b4cdfa575428bc0009136
msgid "ARK FPV Flight Controller Overview"
msgstr "ARK FPV 飞控概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ark-fpv-overview.rst:11
#: a2c398df678b4240a0bd71f10297c4ae
msgid ""
"The ARK FPV NDAA compliant flight controller is based on the `ARKV6X "
"<https://arkelectron.com/product/arkv6x/>`__ in a 30.5mm standard mounting "
"pattern. It supports a 3-12s battery input with a regulated 12V 2A output "
"for video transmitters and payloads."
msgstr ""
"ARK FPV 符合 NDAA 规定的飞控基于 `ARKV6X "
"<https://arkelectron.com/product/arkv6x/>`__，采用 30.5mm 标准安装孔距。支持 3-12S "
"电池输入，为图传和载荷提供稳压 12V 2A 输出。"

